# ============================================================
# CODEOWNERS 示例 — 敏感目录强制双审
# 放到仓库根目录: .github/CODEOWNERS
# 配合分支保护 "Require review from Code Owners" 生效
# 团队名按实际修改 (org/team); 个人建议用团队而非个人, 避免单点
# ============================================================

# --- 认证/授权/支付: 必须 security-team + 业务 owner 双审 ---
/auth/                    @org/security-team @org/backend-owners
/auth/**                  @org/security-team @org/backend-owners
/identity/                @org/security-team @org/backend-owners
/payment/                 @org/security-team @org/fintech-owners
/billing/                 @org/security-team @org/fintech-owners

# --- 密钥与配置 ---
/secrets/**               @org/security-team @org/platform-owners
config/prod/**            @org/security-team @org/platform-owners
config/staging/**         @org/security-team @org/platform-owners

# --- CI/CD 与部署配置 (CI 本身是攻击面) ---
.github/**                @org/platform-owners @org/security-team
Dockerfile*               @org/platform-owners @org/security-team
docker-compose*.yml       @org/platform-owners @org/security-team
*.tf                      @org/platform-owners @org/security-team

# --- 依赖清单变更 ---
package.json              @org/backend-owners @org/security-team
package-lock.json         @org/backend-owners
requirements*.txt         @org/backend-owners
pyproject.toml            @org/backend-owners
go.mod                    @org/backend-owners
go.sum                    @org/backend-owners
renovate.json             @org/security-team

# --- 安全相关文件 ---
.gitleaks.toml            @org/security-team
.semgrep.yaml             @org/security-team
.trivyignore              @org/security-team

# --- 默认兜底: 所有文件至少 backend-owners 评审 ---
*                         @org/backend-owners
